   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Take u = e^x and g(x) = (x - 1)/(x + 1), so u' = e^x, and the quotient rule gives g'(x) = ((x + 1)(1) - (x - 1)(1))/(x + 1)^2 = 2/(x + 1)^2.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            2,
            [
               "Power",
               [
                  "Add",
                  "x",
                  1
               ],
               2
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The product rule gives f'(x) = u' g + u g' = e^x (x - 1)/(x + 1) + e^x (2/(x + 1)^2).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            [
               "Divide",
