               [
                  "Power",
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "x",
                     1
                  ],
                  2
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Over the common denominator (x + 1)^2 the numerator is e^x ((x - 1)(x + 1) + 2) = e^x (x^2 + 1), so f'(x) = e^x (x^2 + 1)/(x + 1)^2.",
